[{"title":"忆吴越风景 其六","author":"唐之淳","text":"最忆吴中与越中，好山相映翠溟濛。\n桃花鸂?三春雨，莼菜鲈鱼九月风。\n李白酒船寻贺老，林逋鹤冢问苏公。\n于今忽作边城客，矫首南云叹转蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37196,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆吴越风景 其七","author":"唐之淳","text":"最忆吴中与越中，山楼月色野亭风。\n江湖鱼菜时时有，村巷桑麻处处同。\n旋折藕花行酒令，细书蕉叶送诗筒。\n于今忽作边城客，归梦常飞东海东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37197,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大宁杂诗 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"正月丹符出紫宸，三军万里净边尘。\n天垂平野星辰近，地入皇图雨露新。\n已见城池开道路，早闻禾黍变荆榛。\n燕然剩有磨崖石，留待班生颂圣明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37198,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大宁杂诗 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"边头极目正漫漫，随处平川似海宽。\n地势北来通白霫，塞尘西去接乌桓。\n冰霜山谷千秋雪，风露衣裳六月寒。\n故国老亲知念我，凭谁传语报平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37199,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大宁杂诗 其三","author":"唐之淳","text":"城郭迢遥雉堞危，新添四面壮威仪。\n日华煖映青油幕，云气时分赤羽旗。\n塞口古河非禹迹，冢边荒寺有唐碑。\n正南回望家山远，挂席三江未可期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37200,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月二十二日雨 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"永夜风翻海，终朝雨蔽天。\n乍醒犹有梦，多冷却思绵。\n白浸千秋雪，青沉万灶烟。\n惟应洗兵马，喜气溢山川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37201,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月二十二日雨 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"茶熟诗成后，香烧睡起初。\n几回闻塞雨，何处得家书。\n云拥门前岫，泉添井畔渠。\n渐看生意满，早晚食园蔬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37202,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"始食菜","author":"唐之淳","text":"脂辖青阳初，结车朱夏末。\n绝塞饶风沙，秋声无时发。\n仆本吴越士，怀归若饥渴。\n况乃藜藿姿，膻食非所悦。\n当庭播嘉种，日夕迟其茁。\n甘雨从东来，夜气亦旁达。\n勾萌既肤寸，颜色转葱郁。\n朝来芼吾羹，风味不可夺。\n未论五内骇，已畏匕箸竭。\n津润生齿牙，精神及毛发。\n道固希为珍，物有微见拔。\n由来盘中飧，岂是塞上物。\n从兹慰羁旅，灌溉自无阙。\n博矣天地仁，永愿充采掇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37203,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对昏镜","author":"唐之淳","text":"白发新添十数茎，苦为看镜太分明。\n如今喜得青铜暗，纱帽笼头照不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37204,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘲破帽","author":"唐之淳","text":"风吹帽破不中修，叶叶乌纱笑黑头。\n莫待学来弓马熟，还家换取铁兜鍪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37205,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步菜畦","author":"唐之淳","text":"雨滋沙土作青泥，芦菔蔓青各自畦。\n今日无风天较暑，纻袍蒲扇觅新题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37206,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚见胡蝶","author":"唐之淳","text":"晚风庭院蝶来频，可是多情慰远人。\n亦欲种花留蝶住，塞天寒冷不禁春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37207,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚望奉怀军前公相","author":"唐之淳","text":"马嘶何当还，鹤望亦已久。\n道远捷报迟，天凉秋气首。\n沙风动百草，城月照高柳。\n心随土河流，迤逦达辽右。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37208,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂阳八咏 其一 金山积雪","author":"唐之淳","text":"积雪不知年，炎天生昼寒。\n南人初出塞，浑作玉屏看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37209,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂阳八咏 其二 富谷晴云","author":"唐之淳","text":"溶溶谷中云，西来复东去。\n云归人未归，朝朝望云树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37210,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂阳八咏 其三 萧寺晓钟","author":"唐之淳","text":"朝听萧寺钟，暮听萧寺钟。\n当年铸钟者，陵云起秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37211,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂阳八咏 其四 玉川秋草","author":"唐之淳","text":"川上王孙草，秋风几度黄。\n太平休战伐，边树射黄羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37212,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂阳八咏 其五 温泉煖浪","author":"唐之淳","text":"玉女来浴时，丹光落秋水。\n到今尚温温，煖浪因风起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37213,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂阳八咏 其六 土河夜雨","author":"唐之淳","text":"滉漾复潆渟，分明见底清。\n涂山一夜雨，流水惠州城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37214,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂阳八咏 其七 西峰夕照","author":"唐之淳","text":"西峰含积阴，落日载暝色。\n照见猎归人，扬声下沙碛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涂阳八咏 其八 东崦春岚","author":"唐之淳","text":"云破始见日，雪消微露岚。\n马头春梦里，惊道是江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37216,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北平白先生并四公子以诗文见寄喜而有作","author":"唐之淳","text":"先生诗篇汉魏体，公子文章云锦才。\n一千里外相忆处，六月尽边方寄来。\n乍惊轩窗灿星斗，已觉怀抱消尘埃。\n安得凌风绿玉杖，共醉秋月黄金台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37217,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋日","author":"唐之淳","text":"炎曦留徂夏，金候应初秋。\n烈风无时作，星火西南流。\n自我违上国，岁月忽已悠。\n匈奴未克夷，王师为淹留。\n宵眠枕干橹，昼食亲戈矛。\n伐榆结庵庐，采菽充乾糇。\n讵无饥寒念，遑恤为安谋。\n所怀药兰北，远在金山陬。\n列营正棋峙，鼎釜尚鱼游。\n贲育奋其武，楼陈壮其犹。\n将略贵持重，皇心在怀柔。\n但俟衔璧至，焉能事穷搜。\n鸟兽尊凤麟，列邦必宗周。\n寄与同征者，薄劳当永休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37218,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂题 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"月没荒城晓角催，风清平野暮云开。\n射雕都尉分弓去，杀虎将军奏捷来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37219,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂题 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"蠮螉塞外风吹雨，鸡鹿山头露欲霜。\n为恐寒惊慈母线，起来先著旧衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37220,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂题 其三","author":"唐之淳","text":"一泓清水古时河，洗马归来饮橐驼。\n不信边州住多日，胡儿头唱汉儿歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37221,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂题 其四","author":"唐之淳","text":"深帽胡鹰绿锦韝，高蹄骏马玉雕锼。\n向人意气争驰猎，欲取沙场第一筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37222,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂题 其五","author":"唐之淳","text":"自为边客早知秋，听得秋声起别愁。\n野粟垂花羊乳子，一年多半在幽州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37223,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂题 其六","author":"唐之淳","text":"处处箫笳接旆旌，时时风雨送秋声。\n紫驼白马三千帐，野草荒烟十二城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37224,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂题 其七","author":"唐之淳","text":"三月边城没酒尝，朝朝饱饭索茶汤。\n有时吟苦心如醉，吟得惊人似醉狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37225,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂题 其八","author":"唐之淳","text":"万里归心折大刀，三军何日解征袍。\n不如归吃南中饭，绿芋红鳞紫蟹螯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37226,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋山晓霁图六言","author":"唐之淳","text":"藤杖高县晓日，笋鞋软踏秋云。\n好拉镜湖贺老，同寻句曲茅君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37227,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉怀北平庄上将出关者 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"使到燕台好趣装，马蹄何日遇滦阳。\n捷书已报还师近，归及秋原草未黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37228,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉怀北平庄上将出关者 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"出关容易入关迟，久客寻常恨别离。\n昨夜灯花开半朵，也因相见不多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37229,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"唐之淳","text":"江南游子辽东客，元夕辞家今七夕。\n塞中烽火几回看，园里嘉蔬三度折。\n今夜月色天下同，牵牛织女精灵通。\n乌鹊桥成夜光湿，黄姑渚落秋机空。\n再拜持觞问牛女，乞取河流化甘雨。\n净洗天兵归内府，万岁千秋奉明主。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37230,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客睡","author":"唐之淳","text":"客睡浑无寐，归心况入秋。\n月色圆又缺，行色去仍留。\n多病非关酒，长吟不破愁。\n家书空写遍，无计达南州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37231,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富谷驿雨过","author":"唐之淳","text":"晴时上马雨时归，马上看山失翠微。\n七十里程三度水，不逢蓑笠尽毡衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37232,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别大宁","author":"唐之淳","text":"十二城中百日留，来逢初夏去逢秋。\n涂山今夜团圆月，犹送清光照马头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37233,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨宿石洞","author":"唐之淳","text":"道傍石壁高崔嵬，上有空洞玲珑开。\n我行遇雨今寄宿，天气黯黮云徘徊。\n洞前秣马洞底卧，蝙蝠飞来虎狼过。\n滴沥微闻谷溜鸣，凌兢恐踏云根破。\n夜深雨逼魂梦寒，意是物外非人间。\n仆夫未眠告明发，回首但觉苍然山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37234,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神仙驿晓发","author":"唐之淳","text":"川光连莽苍，晓气入空虚。\n烽火清平际，城池丧乱馀。\n马谙来路熟，人忆异乡疏。\n记取平戎事，归烦大史书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37235,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宽河城夜宿","author":"唐之淳","text":"新城闻鼓不闻钟，一夜潺湲泻碧峰。\n顷报入关多好梦，明朝应到喜相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入关","author":"唐之淳","text":"六王川上风如猎，九公岭头天似秋。\n欲知地气分南北，减却衣裳入蓟州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37237,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿松亭关有怀松轩公子","author":"唐之淳","text":"独行无所语，公子在何方。\n不作边头客，仍居谷口庄。\n山川欣自慰，书信好谁将。\n今夜松亭梦，琴尊兴甚长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37238,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓟州逢颐庵先生及四公子","author":"唐之淳","text":"四月暌离一日逢，渔阳驿里蓟门东。\n更相存问兼相遇，若个伤离有瘦容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37239,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和颐庵见贻韵","author":"唐之淳","text":"自别金陵笑语稀，中途相见得相依。\n也知幕府无多客，共候将军几日归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37240,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓟州官署松鹤得城字","author":"唐之淳","text":"公馆辟轩楹，长松有鹤鸣。\n色兼秋共迥，声与月同清。\n花向吟边落，苔从舞处生。\n吏归门半掩，不道在边城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37241,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登崆峒山谒崔府君庙得晖字","author":"唐之淳","text":"杳杳祠宫压翠微，团团庭树下晴晖。\n石幢薤叶垂秋露，画壁蛛丝织夜机。\n骏马频嘶知路滑，驯乌不动觉云归。\n欲寻往事题名姓，白发残僧记忆稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37242,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登独乐寺观音阁得闻字","author":"唐之淳","text":"层级带城云，仙凡此地分。\n野花为佛供，庭柏当炉熏。\n雨坏檐前铎，蜗添石上文。\n凭虚应领妙，亦足破声闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37243,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分题得垂丝槐","author":"唐之淳","text":"叶如江上柳枝长，花比岩前桂子黄。\n自笑不随秋试去，却骑戎马入关忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37244,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹤梦得人字","author":"唐之淳","text":"梦随明月下秋旻，敛翅凝眸若有神。\n偶到洞天经赤壁，舟中逢著姓苏人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37245,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登蓟州城楼得园字","author":"唐之淳","text":"塞北城当蓟北门，三河流接九河源。\n霸图已逐秋云远，节制新添虎卫尊。\n几处桑麻思乐业，千家砧杵静朝暾。\n此时天畔登楼望，眼入西风忆故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37246,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香林寺寻僧不遇得霞字","author":"唐之淳","text":"门掩北城霞，庭空驾鹿车。\n留题分贝叶，汲井落藤华。\n不系元无住，忘生讵有家。\n云归占杖锡，人到礼袈裟。\n石响惟闻溜，灯明不碍纱。\n徒劳诸弟子，香饭进胡麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37247,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月二日渔阳驿观降王入朝得青字","author":"唐之淳","text":"此地降王款圣明，千麾万马自龙庭。\n百年王会开图画，一代衣冠见典刑。\n兵气晴连辽水白，路尘秋染蓟峰青。\n伫看大史褒皇化，不但燕然为勒铭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37248,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槐亭得长字","author":"唐之淳","text":"剪翠纳天光，因枝结栋梁。\n月翻苍雪冷，暑借绿云凉。\n户密莺窥惯，檐卑客到妨。\n不同穿蚁穴，诗梦入秋长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37249,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"候国公旌旆未至得春字","author":"唐之淳","text":"辽海无波气色新，路人久已望车尘。\n晓听乌鹊心先喜，夜卜灯花梦转频。\n已见单于来款塞，亦知天子绝和亲。\n几时旌节归台阁，共祝皇基亿万春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37250,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游香林寺得游字","author":"唐之淳","text":"废刹委荒丘，重来是薄游。\n诗因灵辙赋，衣为大颠留。\n榻煖深宜晚，钟清迥得秋。\n细思关去住，欲别更须谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37251,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄香林僧得听字","author":"唐之淳","text":"日斜人散锁寒厅，羁思诗愁两不醒。\n输与山僧无一事，白莲花漏六时听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37252,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松稍月色得西字","author":"唐之淳","text":"鹤枝不动兔轮低，萝径无多影欲齐。\n吟到斗横河汉落，残光犹在画墙西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37253,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吃秋桃有感","author":"唐之淳","text":"看得花开到熟时，一年多半客边陲。\n明年秋摘知何处，重到刘郎未可期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37254,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观蓟州文庙秋奠","author":"唐之淳","text":"画戟门开两陛严，银河不动夜厌厌。\n儒冠晓逐文星集，教雨秋随湛露沾。\n乐备鼓钟明燎火，礼陈牺象列形盐。\n皇威圣德同无外，绝塞偏州喜具瞻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37255,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓟州观市集","author":"唐之淳","text":"九陌动秋烟，千区列土廛。\n物情占贵贱，人语杂幽燕。\n酒瓮黄粱博，柴车黑㹀牵。\n自惊重出塞，聊为买长鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37256,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓟门秋色得消字","author":"唐之淳","text":"秋色望中消，黄微伴碧寥。\n阵边窥万骑，猎处落双雕。\n云白初翻海，虹销半掩桥。\n已今添客恨，仍值雨休朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37257,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻国公重镇大宁得云字","author":"唐之淳","text":"秋风吹角动三军，入塞声为出塞闻。\n后队隔山旗面改，前驱传令马头分。\n朝廷未下还师诏，幕府重书谕蜀文。\n自愧身轻如野鹤，一年来往逐边云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37258,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢姬太守惠鹤","author":"唐之淳","text":"借来公馆作斋居，复有仙禽伴读书。\n每送清音当五夜，时随閒咏及三馀。\n啄残苔径和烟扫，舞罢霜翎带月梳。\n明日南还须爱惜，筠笼轻贮入蓝舆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37259,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋夜燕集","author":"唐之淳","text":"白云破秋色，飞虫起商声。\n渔阳明月夜，钟鼓閟寒城。\n城寒逼塞门，枥马萧萧鸣。\n及兹展良会，座客欣合并。\n飞觞接软语，鹤发间华缨。\n明河西南泻，列宿正纵横。\n虽非帝乡见，稍慰羁旅情。\n木落长白山，霜飘大宁营。\n上公未旋旆，我辈当遐征。\n且尽今夕乐，戎车有严程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37260,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又次颐庵老丈韵","author":"唐之淳","text":"崆峒山前夜看月，月色秋空两奇绝。\n不知何处烂银盘，飞上嗟峨白琼阙。\n蟪蛄啼霜秋气悲，乌鹊绕树人思归。\n天南有星千万点，离恨不敢分明窥。\n亭亭长松古阶下，松枝无声露飘洒。\n倚松踏露劝解公，手中偏著青瑶斝。\n愿公饮此寿百千，乐如食密无中边。\n四夷不惊风雨顺，月光如镜长团圆。\n匣底龙泉玉三尺，英姿自可千金值。\n酒酣拂拭试舞之，虹光倚天如月白。\n今宵之乐当奈何，自古渔阳豪杰多，临风更赋渔阳歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37261,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访马参卿得微字","author":"唐之淳","text":"公馆秋清坐不归，酒卮茶盌送斜晖。\n相逢尽是天涯客，且借桐琴奏式微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37262,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送松轩公子之大宁 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"玉殿承恩日，秋风出塞时。\n山川开道路，书剑逐旌麾。\n文雅时贤惜，聪明圣主知。\n鹡鸰原上望，莫遣马行迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37263,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送松轩公子之大宁 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"四牡去骎骎，来鸿送别音。\n塞云低晚色，关日下秋云。\n箧有新题句，囊馀旧赐金。\n空同今夜客，去住两关心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37264,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]